o 0.827 g. ; ;\nAssay . For methyl salicylate - \n■ r \n. .. .-\nDilute 5 ml to 100 ml with ethanol, further dilute 10ml of \nsolution to 100 ml with ethanol and measure the absorbance \nat the maximum at 306 nm (2.4.7). Calculate the content of\nC8HsQ3 taking 335 as the specific absorbance at 306 hm.\nFor-diethyl, phthalate— -\nFurther dilute 10 ml of the solution prepared in the Assay for \nmethyl salicylate to 50 ml with ethanol and measure the \nabsorbance of the resulting solution at 227 nm (2.4.7). Subtract\nfrom the observed absorbance the absorbance due to the \nmethyl salicylate present, as determined above, taking 432as \nthe specific absorbance of methyl salicylate. For calculation, \ntake:419 as the.specific absorbance of diethyl ptithalate.at \n227nm. \n.urI\nStorage. Store protected from moisture. jOm'.A.;. ‘ \n•?\nLabelling. The label states that the preparation is flammable \nand should be kept away from a naked flame.\nwww.webofpharma.com\n^PHARMACOPOEIA 2022 \n................\nMONOGRAPHS\nt\nPI-U ■■■ \n■ \n'\nTacrolimus\n.... 3701\nTacrolimus Capsules\n.... 3703\nTadalafiLp\n.... 3706\nTadalafilTablets\n.... 3708 .\nTalc ; i\n.... 3709\nTamoxifenCitrate\n.... 3710 ;\nTamoxifenTablets\n.... 3711 \n:\nTainsulpsinHydrochloride\n..... 3713 ,\nTamsulosin Hydrochloridc Prolonged-release Capsules\n.... 3714\nTamsulosin Hydrochloride Prolonged-release and Dutasteride Capsules\n— ; 37,5 ■\nTapentadol Hydrochloride\n..... 3718\n271 Q\nTartancAcid\nTauroursodeoxycholic Acid\nTazobactam?\n: ••• 3720\nTazobactamSodium\n■ - 3721 ■ -\nTeicoplanin ■\n: ■ 3722\n: Teicoplaninlnjection\n- 3724\nTelmisartan .\n.... 3726 .\nTelmisartanTablets\n3727 .\nTelmisartanand Amlodipine Tablets\n.... . 3728\nTelmisartanandHydrochlorothiazide Tablets\n..... 3730\nTemozolomide\n.... 3.732\nTemozolomide Capsules\n.... 3733\nTemozolomide Injection\n3734\nTeneligliptinHydrobrom i de Hydrate\n...... 3733\nTeneHgliptinTablcts\n.... 3737..\nT^neligÿpdp and Metformin Hydrochloride Prolo