016.\nMember\nMember\nProf. Vinod Kumar Dixit\nFormer Dean, Faculty of Pharmacy & \nRetired Professor of Pharmacognosy\nDr. Hari Singh Gour University, \nSagar- 470 003.\nMember\nDr. Sunil Gairola\nExecutive Director\nSerum Institute of India Pvt. Ltd.,\n212/2, Hadapsar, \nPune-411 028.\nMember\nDr. Nithya Gogtay\nAssociate Professor\nDepartment of Clinical Pharmacology \nKEM and SethG, S. Medical College \n'Mumbai-400 012.\nMember\nProf. Ramesh. K. Goyal\nVice Chancellor\n. Delhi Pharmaceutical Sciences & Research\nUniversity\nDi. Raman Mohan Singh \n■\nMember\nDr. PraveenKhullar\nHead ofMSAT,GenMed Cluster.\nEurope &. International, IA GenMed \nSanofi Healthcare (India) Pvt. Ltd.\nL-121, Phase IHA, GIDC\nVerna Industrial Estate\nVerna, Goa-403 722. \n\" ■\n\\, Member\nProf. Sanjay Singh \n■\nMember\nDr. Arun Kumar Mishra\nHead, Global Regulatory\nAffairs-Health & Wellbeing\nUnilever Ltd., \n(iiuugiam -122 001.\n■ \n.’i v\n\".V\nxiv\nINDIAN PHARMACOPOEIA COMMISSION\nIP 2022\n= Member\nDr. AmulyaK. Panda \nv;\n-.a\" Former Director \n■\nNational Institute of Immunolo gy\nAruna Asaf Ali Marg > \nNew Delhi 110 06? .\nShriA.K. Pradhan\nJoint Drugs Controller (I) \n. •\nCDSCO(HQ)\nFDA Bhawan, Kotla Road\nNew Delhi-110 002..\nMember\nDr. D. Srinivasa Reddy\nDirector\nIndian Institute of Integrative Medicine\nPostBagNo. 3, Canal Road\nJammu-180 001.\nMember\nDr. V. Satyanarayana r\nChairman & Managing Director\nM/s. Sipra Labs Ltd.\n7-2-1813/5/AIndustrialEstate\nSanath Nagar\nHyderabad-500018.\nMember\nMember\nDr. Hemant Kumar Sharma\nPresident\nResearch & Development\nAPL Research Centre II\n(A Division of Aurobindo Pharma Ltd.) \nSurvey No. 71 &.72, Indrakaran (V) \nSangareddy (M) \n■\nMedak District 502 329.\nMember\nDr. A.K. Singh\nChief Executive Officer\nBiotechPark\nSector G, Jankipuram, Kiirsi Road,\nM.B.Road, Pushp Vihar, Sector 3 \nDelhi-110 017.\nLucknow - 226 021.\nMember\nDirector\nCentral Drugs Testing. Laboratory\n. Zonal FDA Bhawan, Bellasis Road\n; Govt. Medical Stores Depot .Compound\nMumbai Central \n■ \n;\nMumbai-400 008. ;\n- ViceChancellor \n.... .\nBabasahebBhimraoAmbedkar University \n(A Central University) \n■ \n?\nVidya Vihar, Raebareli Road\nLucknow-226025..\n- •> brrv I.\n1\nwww.webofpharma.com\nIP 2022\nINDIAN PHARMACOPOEIA COMMISSION\nMember \nDr. Rakesh Narayanrao Tirpude\nAssistant Commissioner. \nFood & Drugs Administration \nMaharashtra State \nMumbai-400051. \n■ \n;\nMember \nDr. Anil Kumar Tyagi\n. \nCSO,R&D Department\nMankind Pharma Ltd. :\n■ 208, Okhla Industrial Estate, Phase III\nNewDelhi-110 020.\nMember' Shri SalimA; Veljee ■\nFormer Director \nDirectorate of Food & Drugs Administration\n‘Dhanwantari’, \nOpp. Shrine of the Holy Cross\n’ Bambolim .\nGoa 403 202.\nMember \nDr. Ram A. Vishwakarma\n.. . Former Director\nIndian Institute of Integrative Medicine \nPost Bag No. 3, Canal Road\n■ Jammu-180001. . . ,. ; . \n,.\nMember Prof. Naveet Wig:\nHead, Department of Medicine \nAll India Institute of Medical Sciences-Delhi \n■Ansari Nagar\nNew Delhi-110029. \n: ; \n■\nMember- The Secretary-cum-Scientific Director \nSecretary Indian Pharmacopoeia Commission\n(ex-o#zcio) Sector-23., Raj Nagar . \n■■\n. Ghaziabad 201002\n(Dr. Rajeev Singh Raghuvanshi);\nExpert Working Groups\nReview of IP Work\nProf. C.K.Kokate, Dr. D.B. Anantha Narayana, Dr. Nitya Anand, \nMr. J. L. Sipahimalani, Prof.- Rama Shanker Verma, Mr. R.\nSridharah, Mr. . R. Raghunandanan, Prof. Safanjit Singh, \nMr. VinodArora. \n■\nSub-Group for Review of IP Wor k.\nDr. Ajay Sachan, Mr. Gauiang Oza.Dr. N. Murugesan, \nDr. Ramah Mohan Singh, Mr. S.L. Jat;Mr. S.S. Venkatkrishnah.\nActive Pharmaceutical Ingredients\nDr.. Srinivasa Reddy, Dr. Raman Nanduri, Dr, Rajasekhar \nAkkaraju, Dr. Suryanarayana Mulukutla, Dr. Ch. V.V. Raju.\nAllergen\nDr. S.N. Gaur, Prof. M.K. Agarwal, Dr. Sutya Kant, Dr. A.K. \nJain,Dr. Naveen Arora, Dr. W.A. Shaikh,Dr. Nagendra Prasad, \nDr. S.E. Reddy, Dr. Jai Prakash, Dr. Achla Prasad.\nAnti-Cancer\nMr. Ajay Shankar Singh, Mr, Bobby George, Mr. Mohan Jain, \nDr. N. Padmaja, Dr. S. D. Sinha, Dr. Sanjeev Kumar.\nAnti-Retroviral\nDr. Shripad D. Banavali, Dr. Imtiyaz Basade, Dr. Manish \nGangrade, Dr. Nilesh Jha, Dr. Kishor Shenoy P., Dr. Radhay \nShyam Gupta, DnK. Rathnakar Reddy.\nAnti-Sera\nDr. Krishna MohanB., Dr. Aldon Fernandes, Dr. Sumhilt Kamik, \nMs Leena Menghaney, Dr. Amulya K. Panda, Dr. Nitin Salvi, \nDr, Anil Yadav, Dr, Anand Zachariah, Nominee of CDL, Kasauli, \nNominee of CRl, Kasauli, Nominee of CDSCO and Nominee\nof IPC.\nBiological and rDNA Products\nDr. Surinder Singh, Dr. A. Ramkishan, Dr. Jaspreet Singh, \nDr. C. Nirmala Raju, Ms. Meenu Batolar, Mr. Parveen Jain, \nDr. Rahul Kulkarni, Prof. Rarria Shanker Verma, Dr. Sriram \nAkundi, Dr. Samir Sangitrao, Dr. V. G. Somani, Dr. Rajesh Singh.\nBlood and Blood Related Prodncts\nDr. Debasish Gupta, Dr. J. P. Prasad, Ms. Kanchan Ahuja, \nDr. Ranjeet S. Ajmani, Dr. Rajendra Chaudhary. Dr. Ratti Ram \nShanna.\nClinical Medicine and Phar macology\nProf. Y. K. Gupta, Dr. C. B. Tripathi, Prof. Praveeri Agrawal, \nProf. Rakesh Yadav, Dr. Pooja Gupta.\nExcipients\nDr?Anil Kumar Tyagi, Dr. Aj aya Prakash, Dr. Ashok Panwar, \nDr, P.B.N. Frasad, Dr. Rajasekhar Akkafajti, Dr, Subodh Priolkar.\nFixed Dose Combinations\nDr. Praveen Khullar, Dr. Rajiv Desai, Mr. Rahul Dev, Mr. Sanjeev"},{"name":"Impurities","text":"2.4.7 Ultraviolet and Visible \nAbsorption Spectro­\nphotometry\n5.9 \nReference Substances\nGeneral Monographs.\nCapsules\n2.4.13 \nGas Chromatography . .\nInhalation Preparations\n2.4.1 - Liquid,Chromatography .\nParenteral Preparations\n2.4,15 \nPaper Chromatography <\nMonographs on Drug substances, \nDosage,forms and Pharmaceutical aids\n2.4.17 \nThin-layer Chromatography\nAmantadine Capsules ’\n2.4.22 \nOptical Rotation and Specific;\nOptical Rotation ■_ .. ..\n2.4-26 \n,■ ; Solubility, ... j ..\nAmiloride and Hydrochlorothiazide\n' Tablets- - ■ \n...\n2.4.42 \nInductively Coupled Plasma\nSpectrometry . \n■ . 